p,q,r=t.children(m,[('After any finite sequence of subset-only stages,1 remains absent.','Induction: base D1 lacks1; each subset stage preserves absence.'),('An alternative stage that explicitly reintroduces1 is outside the subset-only premise.','Adding an absent element violates subset containment.'),('Changing the name of a surviving item is not restoration of the original probability value1.','Item identity in this fixture is its probability value, not its display name.')])
s,u,v=t.children(p,[('A final existence test limited to these survivors returns no joint S-and-M witness.','All S witnesses require1, which the parent excludes.'),('That final no-witness answer differs from the original-D query answer yes.','R9’s original witness and parent exclusion concern different domains.'),('The false-negative behavior depends on answering the original query from only the pruned domain.','If the query instead explicitly asks about survivors, its no-witness answer is true.')])
# Eight additional expansions, each on a different concrete boundary or observable.
