t.children(c,[('M does not imply S on D.','The parent supplies a specific counterexample1/2.'),('An existence test for M alone accepts1/2.','The tested predicate is M and it holds there.'),('The fact that M alone accepts1/2 does not certify the conjunction there.','S is false at the same point.')])
