t.children(l,[('A high-weight copy of a surviving non-witness remains a non-witness.','Weight is not an input to S or M.'),('A low-weight retained1 would still be a valid witness if Q were changed to keep it.','Predicates do not consume weight, while retention is explicitly changed.'),('Weight-only repair and membership repair are different interventions on this fixture.','One leaves Q’s output fixed; the other changes the admitted point.')])
