s,u,v=t.children(p,[('The constant-feature augmentation still leaves at least one strict .2 loss among the admitted models.','Its common action is either buy or now; R9/R10 give the corresponding losing model.'),('The augmentation cannot truthfully certify zero regret for both models.','The parent provides a nonzero-loss case.'),('A narrower model set containing only A or only B removes the two-model contradiction but adds a model-identification premise.','A single retained model has one specified optimum; exclusion of the other is additional information.')])
