t.children(c,[('At prior .5, both accuracies equal half the sum of sensitivity and specificity, namely.8.','Each pair sums to1.6.'),('The shared accuracy constraint permits more than the two displayed matrices.','Sensitivity a in[.6,1] and false-positive rate a−.6 preserve.8.'),('The two displayed matrices therefore establish non-identification without proving they exhaust the source’s possibilities.','Two witnesses suffice for nonuniqueness; no exhaustive-source premise is given.')])
